cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SeisConv in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SeisConv"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform desktop toolkit for seismic exploration data:
  convert, inspect, view, and QC SEG-Y, SEG-D, SEG-2, and Seismic Unix
  files and survey geometry (SPS, IOGP P1/11, P6/11), with vibroseis
  sweep design and peer-to-peer field file sync.
authors:
